---
title: Preemption Flow (High-Priority App Needs Resources)
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    
    participant EV as Event Trigger
    participant SC as Scheduler Core
    participant WS as World State
    participant PE as Placement Engine
    participant PX as Plan Executor
    participant CC as Cluster Client
    participant VOL as Volcano
    participant NODE as K8s Node

    EV->>SC: NewApp(app=Y, priority=P0, gpus=8)
    
    SC->>WS: snapshot()
    WS-->>SC: WorldState snapshot
    
    SC->>PE: compute_placement(targets)
    
    Note over PE: No 8-GPU contiguous block available<br/>Must preempt lower priority workload
    
    PE->>PE: find_preemption_opportunity(P0, 8 GPUs)
    
    Note over PE: Found: App Z (P2) has replica<br/>on node-5 using 8 GPUs<br/>Z has 3 replicas, min=2, can preempt 1
    
    PE-->>SC: PlacementPlan:<br/>preemptions=[(Z, replica-z-1, grace=10s)]<br/>scale_ups=[(Y, us-west-1, prefer=[node-5])]
    
    SC->>PX: execute(plan)
    
    rect rgb(255, 230, 230)
        Note over PX,NODE: Phase 1: Preemption
        PX->>CC: preempt(replica-z-1, grace=10s)
        CC->>CC: label_pod(draining=true)
        CC->>NODE: delete_pod(grace_period=10s)
        NODE->>NODE: SIGTERM to container
        
        Note over NODE: Drain period: 10s<br/>Complete in-flight requests
        
        NODE-->>CC: Pod terminated
        CC-->>PX: Preemption complete
    end
    
    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over PX,NODE: Phase 2: Scale-up (after preemption)
        PX->>CC: create_pod(Y, prefer=[node-5])
        CC->>VOL: Pod spec with nodeAffinity<br/>preferring node-5
        
        Note over VOL: node-5 now has 8 free GPUs<br/>Matches preference
        
        VOL->>VOL: bind(node-5)
        VOL-->>CC: Pod scheduled
        
        CC->>CC: wait_for_running()
        NODE-->>CC: Pod running
        CC-->>PX: Scale-up complete
    end
    
    PX-->>SC: ExecutionResult: success
    
    Note over SC: P0 app Y now running<br/>P2 app Z reduced to 2 replicas
